document.attention:
One line per command that earned attention marks, "where || label, ...".
"(none)" when no command matched:
{{ATTENTION}}

review_prompt.output_format:
Answer with one JSON object and nothing else, exactly this shape:
{"verdict": "looks-safe" | "needs-look" | "flagged", "reasons": "one short paragraph, empty string when looks-safe has nothing to add", "patterns": ["slugs from the list above, graphs only"]}
No markdown fences, no commentary, no extra keys.
